# End-to-end testing

- Use Playwright in `myOwnWebsite/e2e`. Spec files end with `.spec.ts`.
- Chromium / Desktop Chrome only. Do not add Firefox or WebKit projects unless asked.
- Prefer role, label, and accessible name locators over CSS or test ids.
- Put a positive assertion (element is visible) before a negative one.
- Reuse helpers in `e2e/helpers/` (for example `goToHome`) instead of duplicating navigation.
- If a test fails, fix the test first. Do not change product behaviour to make a test pass unless the owner agrees there is a product bug.
- `npm test` in `myOwnWebsite` is the command for local and CI. Playwright builds and previews the site via `webServer`.
